  "description": "$D_{9}$ invariant of $SU(2)_{14}$ (Cappelli-Itzykson-Zuber), a permutation invariant (odd $l$ paired with $14-l$); equivalently the orbifold of the diagonal theory by the $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ centre, which keeps the untwisted states with even $l$ and adds the twisted-sector states $\\chi_l\\overline{\\chi_{14-l}}$ with $l$ odd. Blocks are $SU(2)_{14}$ characters and $Z$ gives their multiplicities.",
